          "width": "400.0px",
          "height": "250.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap');</style><h2 style='font-family: \"Cormorant Garamond\", serif; color: #2c4c3b; font-size: 32px; margin: 0 0 20px 0;'>The Art of Slow Living</h2><p style='font-family: sans-serif; color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;'>In our fast-paced world, choosing to slow down is an act of rebellion. It's about finding joy in the quiet moments\u2014the steam rising from your morning tea, the texture of a leaf, the sound of your own breath. This month, we explore practices that ground us.</p>",
